; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) — draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid
; These records must be published at the DNS host for masukusafaris.com.
; A file on the website cannot satisfy this check.
;
; Current nameservers: dns1.registrar-servers.com (Namecheap BasicDNS).
; Namecheap Advanced DNS often has TXT, and sometimes HTTPS, but not SVCB.
; The isitagentready scanner queries SVCB, HTTPS, and TXT under _agents.
;
; Fastest path that can pass:
;   1. Cloudflare (free): add the SVCB/HTTPS records below, DNS-only (grey cloud).
;      Then enable DNSSEC and add the DS record back at Namecheap.
;   2. Stay on Namecheap: add the TXT records now. If the panel has HTTPS,
;      add those too. Enable DNSSEC under Domain List → Manage → DNSSEC.
;
; Namecheap Advanced DNS fields: Type / Host / Value / TTL 3600
; Cloudflare: Type SVCB or HTTPS / Name = Host / Priority 1 / Target masukusafaris.com /
;             Value alpn="h2,h3" port=443 / Proxy DNS only

; Well-known entrypoints (scanner checks www first, then apex)
_index._agents.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN SVCB 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443
_index._agents.www.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN SVCB 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443
_mcp._agents.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN SVCB 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443
_mcp._agents.www.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN SVCB 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443
_a2a._agents.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443
_a2a._agents.www.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443
_index._agents.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN TXT "v=dnsaid1;alpn=h2,h3;port=443;target=masukusafaris.com;mcp=https://masukusafaris.com/api/mcp;cap=https://masukusafaris.com/.well-known/agent-index.json"
_index._agents.www.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN TXT "v=dnsaid1;alpn=h2,h3;port=443;target=masukusafaris.com;mcp=https://masukusafaris.com/api/mcp;cap=https://masukusafaris.com/.well-known/agent-index.json"

; Site HTTPS bindings
masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 . alpn="h2,h3"
www.masukusafaris.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 masukusafaris.com. alpn="h2,h3"

; HTTP index fallback: https://masukusafaris.com/.well-known/agent-index.json
; Masuku Adventure Safaris MCP: https://masukusafaris.com/api/mcp

